  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "队友能互相拉上高台，并布置绳索和攀岩钉，为后续成员建立更安全的登山路线。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Help each other up ledges, or place ropes and climbing spikes to make the way easier for those who come after.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3527290/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "登山途中必须搜寻可疑食物并谨慎处理伤势，因为每次受挫都会压低体力上限，让继续攀爬更困难。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "You’ll need to scavenge for questionable food to survive, and manage your injuries carefully - every setback limits your stamina, making it harder to climb.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3527290/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "岛屿地图每24小时轮换一次，既能每天挑战新布局，也能在当天反复尝试同一座岛直到征服。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "The game's map rotates out every 24 hours! Try out the new layout each day, or give the same island multiple attempts in a day until you conquer it.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3527290/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
